 with slatted privacy screen and wicker seating beside a curved pool\"><img src=\"/images/banco/pergolas/freestanding-patio-cover-bronze-pool-deck-travertine-florida-01.webp\" alt=\"Freestanding bronze insulated pergola with slatted privacy screen and wicker seating beside a curved pool\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1080\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 25vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda mm-celda--resto\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/furniture-8/custom-outdoor-furniture-builders-florida-08.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Luxury outdoor lounge pod installed beside waterfront pool in North Florida, showcasing custom-built relaxation furniture.\"><img src=\"/images/images/furniture-8/custom-outdoor-furniture-builders-florida-08.jpg\" alt=\"Luxury outdoor lounge pod installed beside waterfront pool in North Florida, showcasing custom-built relaxation furniture.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"698\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 25vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda mm-celda--resto\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/furniture-7/custom-outdoor-furniture-builders-florida-07.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Outdoor conversation set with fire feature installed in South Florida, enhancing backyard living with premium furniture solutions.\"><img src=\"/images/images/furniture-7/custom-outdoor-furniture-builders-florida-07.jpg\" alt=\"Outdoor conversation set with fire feature installed in South Florida, enhancing backyard living with premium furniture solutions.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"698\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 25vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button></div></div></section><section class=\"mm-proc mm-proc--sin\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Our Outdoor Furniture <span class=\"mm-rot\">Process</span></h2><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">Our team guides Florida homeowners in selecting and installing premium outdoor furniture for lasting comfort and beauty on patios and pool areas.</p><div class=\"mm-sec-acc\"><a class=\"mm-btn mm-btn--linea\" href=\"#estimate\">Get a Free Estimate</a></div></div></div><div class=\"mm-proc-cuerpo\"><ol class=\"mm-pasos\"><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">1</span><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Planning &amp; Selection</h3><p>Contract execution, project documentation, and selection of outdoor furniture to match the design and client preferences.</p></li><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">2</span><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Order Placement</h3><p>Furniture is ordered and confirmed with supplier, including lead times and specifications.</p></li><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">3</span><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Delivery Scheduling</h3><p>Coordinate and schedule delivery to align with project completion and site readiness. Furniture is delivered, placed, and arranged in the designated areas.</p></li><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">4</span><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Final Touches &amp; Enjoyment</h3><p>Final adjustments completed and space is ready for use and enjoyment.</p></li></ol></div></section><section class=\"mm-que mm-que--sin\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><div class=\"mm-sec-tit\"><p class=\"mm-etiqueta\">What do we do!</p><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Custom Outdoor Furniture Design, Installation &amp; Renovation</h2></div><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">We curate and install premium outdoor furniture in teak, aluminum, and wicker for North and South Florida homes and estates.</p><div class=\"mm-sec-acc\"><a class=\"mm-btn mm-btn--linea\" href=\"#estimate\">Get a Free Estimate</a></div></div></div><div class=\"mm-que-cuerpo\"><div class=\"mm-que-col\"><ol class=\"mm-grupos\"><li class=\"mm-grupo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Custom Layouts, Modular Seating</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">We size dining sets, sectionals, and chaises to the lanai, pool deck, or terrace they will sit on, so walkways, door swings, and screen enclosure posts stay clear. Modular sections rearrange for a family dinner or a twenty-person party, so one set covers both.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Custom Patio Furniture Design</dt><dd>South Florida designers create custom outdoor furniture plans tailored to homeowners’ style and space</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Modular Seating Design &amp; Installation</dt><dd>Installers create modular seating arrangements to maximize patio space and flexibility</dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"mm-grupo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Teak, Hardwood &amp; Aluminum</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">Teak and dense tropical hardwoods hold up to Florida humidity and weather down to a gray patina you can leave alone or re-oil. Powder-coated aluminum stays light enough to carry indoors and resists salt-air corrosion. We use stainless hardware on both, since plated fasteners corrode first.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Teak &amp; Hardwood Furniture Installation</dt><dd>Installers assemble and install durable teak and hardwood furniture sets for residential patios.</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Aluminum Furniture Assembly Services</dt><dd>Contractors install lightweight, rust‑resistant aluminum furniture for long‑lasting outdoor use.</dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"mm-grupo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Wicker Lounges, Sustainable Sourcing</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">All-weather resin wicker woven over aluminum frames keeps its color under Florida UV instead of turning brittle like natural rattan. We cover cushions in solution-dyed acrylic that sheds an afternoon downpour and resists mildew, and we source FSC-certified teak and recycled-content frames on request.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Wicker Lounge Set Installation</dt><dd>Builders set up weather‑proof wicker lounges and seating areas that blend comfort and style</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Sustainable Outdoor Furniture Solutions</dt><dd>Designers recommend eco‑friendly materials and accessories for environmentally conscious homeowners</dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"mm-grupo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Refinishing, Delivery &amp; Placement</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">Good frames outlast their finish, so we sand and re-oil teak, re-strap aluminum, and rebuild cushions rather than replace a set that still fits. Our crews deliver, assemble, and place each piece, keep egress paths clear, and leave lightweight items easy to stow when a storm watch goes up.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Outdoor Furniture Renovation Services</dt><dd>Contractors refurbish existing furniture with durable finishes and cushions for continued use.</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Professional Furniture Installation &amp; Staging</dt><dd>South Florida installers professionally place and secure outdoor furniture for a polished look.</dd></div></dl></li></ol><div class=\"mm-datos mm-datos--tel\"><a class=\"mm-dato\" href=\"tel:+13527403361\"><span class=\"mm-dato-val\">+1 (352) 740-3361</span></a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"mm-cat\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Project <span class=\"mm-rot\">Gallery</span></h2><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">See pools, pergolas and outdoor kitchens we have built for Florida homeowners.</p><div class=\"mm-sec-acc\"><a class=\"mm-btn mm-btn--linea\" href=\"#estimate\">Get a Free Estimate</a></div></div></div><ul class=\"mm-cat-fila\" role=\"list\"><li class=\"mm-cat-tesela\"><span class=\"mm-cat-foto\"><img src=\"/images/obra/teselas/gallery-tile-pools-and-spas-480.webp\" alt=\"Pool with raised glass-tile spa in front of a louvered pergola and outdoor bar.\" width=\"1280\" height=\"960\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" sizes=\"(min-width: 992px) 17vw, (min-width: 768px) 33vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"/images/obra/teselas/gallery-tile-pools-and-spas-480.webp 480w, /images/obra/teselas/gallery-tile-pools-and-spas-800.webp 800w, /images/obra/teselas/gallery-tile-pools-and-spas-1200.webp 1200w\" style=\"object-position:50% 20%\"></span><h3 class=\"mm-cat-t\">Pools &amp; Spas</h3><p class=\"mm-cat-p\"><span>Custom inground pools and spas, engineered and permitted.</span> <a class=\"mm-cat-ver\" href=\"/gallery/pools-and-spas\">See photos<span class=\"mm-sr\"> of pools &amp; spas</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"></path></svg></a></p></li><li class=\"mm-cat-tesela\"><span class=\"mm-cat-foto\"><img src=\"/images/obra/teselas/gallery-tile-pool-remodeling-480.webp\" alt=\"Remodeled rectangular pool with a blue glass tile waterline and a textured deck under a screen enclosure.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" sizes=\"(min-width: 992px) 17vw, (min-width: 768px) 33vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"/images/obra/teselas/gallery-tile-pool-remodeling-480.webp 480w, /images/obra/teselas/gallery-tile-pool-remodeling-800.webp 800w, /images/obra/teselas/gallery-tile-pool-remodeling-1200.webp 1200w\" style=\"object-position:50% 50%\"></span><h3 class=\"mm-cat-t\">Pool Remodeling</h3><p class=\"mm-cat-p\"><span>Resurfacing, new tile, decks and water features.</span> <a class=\"mm-cat-ver\" href=\"/gallery/pool-remodeling\">See photos<span class=\"mm-sr\"> of pool remodeling</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"></path></svg></a></p></li><li class=\"mm-cat-tesela\"><span class=\"mm-cat-foto\"><img src=\"/images/obra/teselas/gallery-tile-aluminum-pergolas-480.webp\" alt=\"Freestanding bronze insulated pergola wit