const T4 = "<section class=\"mm-faq\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Outdoor Furniture <span class=\"mm-rot\">FAQs</span></h2><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">Have questions about premium outdoor furniture in Florida? Our team helps North and South Florida homeowners select and install durable pieces.</p></div></div><div class=\"mm-faq-cuerpo\"><div class=\"mm-faq-lista\"><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>What outdoor materials last longest in Florida climates?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Teak, powder-coated aluminum, and high-density polyethylene wicker all resist humidity, salt air, and UV exposure — making them ideal for Florida's coastal and inland climates. These materials maintain structural integrity and appearance without the warping, rust, or fading common with lower-grade outdoor materials.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>How do I care for teak outdoor furniture in Florida?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Teak outdoor furniture requires minimal care in Florida climates, as its natural oils protect against rot, pest damage, and warping even in direct sun and coastal humidity. Occasional cleaning and optional oiling every one to two years maintains the wood's rich appearance and extends the life of your investment significantly.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>Is HDPE wicker furniture durable in Florida's climate?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Yes. High-density polyethylene wicker is engineered to resist UV fading, moisture absorption, cracking, and mold growth — making it one of the most durable outdoor furniture materials for Florida's humid, sun-intense climate. HDPE wicker maintains its color and structural integrity for many years with only occasional cleaning required.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>Do outdoor cushions resist Florida sun and humidity?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Premium outdoor cushions use solution-dyed acrylic fabrics engineered for UV fading, mildew, and moisture resistance. These quick-dry materials are designed for Florida's intense sun and frequent rain. Properly maintained cushions retain their color and shape across multiple years of year-round outdoor use in South Florida.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>Can you help design the layout of my outdoor space?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Our design team provides personalized layout guidance to arrange outdoor furniture for optimal traffic flow and visual proportion on your Florida patio or pool deck. From selecting the right scale of pieces to coordinating finishes with your home's exterior, every installation reflects the aesthetic of a well-designed outdoor space.</p></div></details></div><div class=\"mm-faq-lado\"><figure class=\"mm-lam-medio mm-faq-medio\"><img class=\"mm-lam-foto\" sizes=\"(min-width: 992px) 42vw, 100vw\" src=\"/images/banco/louvered/louvered-pergola-bronze-closed-roof-dining-area-florida-01.webp\" alt=\"Bronze louvered pergola with closed roof over a wicker dining set on a travertine pool deck\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><div class=\"mm-faq-accion\"><a class=\"mm-btn\" href=\"#estimate\">Get a Free Estimate</a><div class=\"mm-datos mm-datos--tel\"><a class=\"mm-dato\" href=\"tel:+13527403361\"><span class=\"mm-dato-val\">+1 (352) 740-3361</span></a></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"mm-zonas\"><div class=\"mm-zonas-caja\"><div class=\"mm-zonas-txt\"><div class=\"mm-sec-tit\"><h2 class=\"mm-etiqueta\">Where We Serve</h2><p class=\"mm-h2\">Regional <span class=\"mm-rot\">Coverage</span> With National Vision</p></div><div class=\"mm-zonas-lista\"><article class=\"mm-zona\"><h3 class=\"mm-zona-t\">North Florida</h3><p>Licensed luxury pool builders in North Florida specializing in custom inground pools and outdoor living design-build projects, engineered for structural integrity and long-term durability.</p><a class=\"mm-flecha\" href=\"/where-we-serve/north-florida\">View North Florida Service Areas<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"></path></svg></a></article><article class=\"mm-zona\"><h3 class=\"mm-zona-t\">South Florida</h3><p>Licensed luxury pool builders in South Florida specializing in custom inground pools and outdoor living design-build projects, engineered, permitted, and built for high-end residential properties.</p><a class=\"mm-flecha\" href=\"/where-we-serve/south-florida\">View South Florida Service Areas<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"current